<title>USA: General Signal unit shows new pump line.</title>
<headline>General Signal unit shows new pump line.</headline>
<dateline>NORTH AURORA, Ill. 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>General Signal Pump Group, a unit of General Signal Corp, said Monday it introduced its new Autora Pump line of in-line mounted centrifugal pumps for the commercial market.</p>
<p>It said the 326A Series of pumps, which can handle capacities of 140 gallons per minute, were shown at a trade show in Philadelphia.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
